{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATION OF THE GODS: Rebellion at Five Passes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an authentic Chinese RPG adventure, inspired by the legendary novel &quot;CREATION OF THE GODS&quot;! Experience the epic saga with unparalleled faithfulness \u2013 this is the <i>only</i> RPG to truly adapt the original story. Follow Huang Feihu's defiant flight from Chaoge, chase Grand Tutor Wen's relentless pursuit, witness Huang Tianhua's daring rescue at Tong Pass, and see Nezha shatter Sishui Pass...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative: Uncover strategy and exploration within a classic, linear story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Discover a world of wonder: All characters, divine beasts, magical treasures, and environments are brought to life with exquisite, hand-drawn pixel art!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/extras/8788172d0e99efe01a5455345695fd68.avif?t=1759917551\" width=616 height=4800 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908250?t=1759917551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/e9057b6ea7099da2c80108a263a232008fe38f3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759917551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/de2f2675ca7be0988afdcd8afba00d3d78238243/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759917551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908250/de2f2675ca7be0988afdcd8afba00d3d78238243/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759917551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4050140,"description":""}],"detailed_desc